    "extraction_notes": [
      "PDF SHA-256 verified as eeb77495cf5590f6b551c77525d0ceee9acb41544d5828ba96a44c613d041c1c.",
      "The supplied datasheet identifies LBC817-16LT1G as an NPN silicon transistor from Leshan Radio Company, Ltd. and marks the revision Rev.O.",
      "Curve points are manual digitizations of the visible 25 degC traces on p. 3 figs. 1 to 4. Points are sampled from the plotted traces and are not interpolated between undisplayed measurements.",
      "The hFE table gives guaranteed minimum 100 and maximum 250 at IC = 100 mA, VCE = 1.0 V, plus minimum 40 at IC = 500 mA, VCE = 1.0 V. These bounds remain tagged as minimum or maximum and were not converted to typical values.",
      "The datasheet publishes only one VCE(sat) table row, a maximum of 0.7 V at IC = 500 mA and IB = 50 mA. The two lower-current saturation points are digitized typical values from the 25 degC IC/IB = 10 trace.",
      "VBE(on) is tabulated only as a maximum of 1.2 V at IC = 500 mA, VCE = 1.0 V; the strict schema has no VBE(on) scalar field, so the value is retained in the extraction notes and the 25 degC typical curve is represented separately.",
      "Cobo is transcribed from the typical table row. Cibo has no scalar table row and is omitted rather than inferred from the capacitance figure.",
      "No output-characteristics figure or Early-voltage value is published for this device."
    ],
